# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Horde, part 2 of 2 (NewZones038, 2026-11-11). Hand-written from
# players' recordings (3-14 people per quest), with Forever's quest data for titles, levels and objectives.
# Order: Powderfuse Port (the neutral goblin port) and its coasts, Sleebo's workshop, Sunnyglade (Tran'gul's and
# Clubtoe's Twilight cult quests), the ogres of Bolder'ok and Na'zok's camp in the north, back to Rog'mar, then
# the flight to Kargath, where our Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows guide (39-43) starts.
# Left out on purpose:
# - WANTED: Old Rot-Chum (95120), Spread the Word (95418), Land of Giants (95420), Twilight No More! (95427):
#   Old Rot-Chum and Chogg'Zac are elites (levels 41-42): each behind a group choice only.
# - The Bloodmaster's Ring fights (Pay to Play 94669 and the bouts after it): elite arena fights, for a group.
# - Unworthy Champion (95425): its Skullbasher comes from a fight nobody recorded solo.
# - The Eastsea pirates' second wave (95122, 95123, 95165, 95124): levels 44-45, above this leg.
# - The Wayward Warrior (94744) and Da'grosh's quests: two to three recorded players, levels 41-43.
# - Paletusk Harvesting (95162): its Chunks of Boar Meat drop from Forever's Paletusk boars, which our item data
#   doesn't list as droppers yet (an item correction can't add a dropper).

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip East down the road from Rog'mar to Powderfuse Port, the goblins' harbour on the coast. Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall in the middle of the docks, Fimbo Greasemitz cooks by the inn, Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz and Argo Brinewhistle work the north pier.
  turnin 93976                          -- Friz Frazzlespark: The Goblin Trader
  accept 95288                          -- Smuggler's Paradise
  accept 95293                          -- Smuggler's Special
  accept 95062                          -- Frazzlespark's Crate: for Krom'rosh in Rog'mar, keep it
  accept 95121                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz: A Taste of the Sea
  accept 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz: Saltwater Savages
  accept 95119                          -- Unfriendly Competition
  accept 95254 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn: Trapclaw

step The south coast
  tip South along the shore from the port: the saltwater murlocs camp on the beaches; the sand crawlers drop the meat.
  kill 256801 x8 quest 95118.1          -- Murloc Warrior
  kill 255898 x8 quest 95118.2          -- Murloc Oracle
  collect 268344 x12 quest 95121.1 @72.5,67.7  -- Saltwater Murloc Eye
  collect 268345 x6 quest 95121.2 @78.7,49.0  -- Sand Crawler Meat

step Old Rot-Chum
  when group 95120
  tip Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42) on the south shore: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95120 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn
  collect 268341 quest 95120.1 @77.6,72.0  -- Rot-Covered Harpoon
  turnin 95120                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz

step Trapclaw
  tip Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the port.
  collect 268586 quest 95254.1 @83.0,50.5  -- Trapclaw's Pincer

step The Eastsea pirates
  tip North-east along the coast to the pirates' camp on the cliffs. The buccaneers and musketeers carry the smuggled goods. Captain Bentcoin and Captain Haynes wait at the far end of the camp, by the water.
  kill 257901 x10 quest 95119.1         -- Eastsea Buccaneer
  kill 257910 x10 quest 95119.2         -- Eastsea Musketeer
  collect 268796 x8 quest 95288.1 @86.4,38.1  -- Smuggled Goods
  turnin 95293 @91.2,39.8               -- Captain Bentcoin
  accept 95294 @91.2,39.8               -- Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain

step Powderfuse Port
  turnin 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95119
  turnin 95254                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz
  turnin 95121
  turnin 95288                          -- Friz Frazzlespark
  turnin 95294

step Sleebo's workshop
  tip West up the road from the port: Sleebo Fizzlespout has his workshop on the hill.
  accept 96063                          -- Gaseous Gold
  accept 96067                          -- Rock 'em and Sock 'em
  complete 96067 @68.2,48.6             -- the stress test: fight G45-B4G beside the workshop

step The marsh
  tip South-west of the workshop the marsh bubbles with gas: fill the vials at the vents.
  collect 272004 x8 quest 96063.1 @62.2,58.7  -- Marsh Gas Vial

step Sleebo Fizzlespout
  turnin 96063
  turnin 96067

step Rog'mar
  tip West back to Rog'mar.
  turnin 95062                          -- Krom'rosh
  accept 94672                          -- Tran'gul: Encroaching Twilight
  accept 94680                          -- Twilight Missives

step Sunnyglade
  tip West of Rog'mar the Twilight cult holds the farm town of Sunnyglade. The Shadowmancers carry the missives.
  kill 256952 x8 quest 94672.1          -- Twilight Raider
  kill 254560 x8 quest 94672.2          -- Twilight Shadowmancer
  kill 256798 x8 quest 94672.3          -- Twilight Neophyte
  collect 265745 x3 quest 94680.1 @48.1,47.0  -- Twilight Missive

step Tran'gul
  turnin 94672
  turnin 94680
  accept 94727                          -- Digging for Answers

step Clubtoe
  tip Clubtoe, a Twilight miner who wants out, waits at the eastern edge of Sunnyglade.
  turnin 94727                          -- Clubtoe
  accept 95417                          -- The Purple Ones
  accept 95602                          -- Sickening Lights
  turnin 95417 @49.3,46.8               -- Twilight Brute, a few steps west
  accept 95601 @49.3,46.8               -- The Purple Ones

step The ritual grounds
  tip The ritualists and their empowered brutes gather at the ritual circles in the middle of Sunnyglade: wreck five of the circles.
  kill 261711 x5 quest 95601.1 @48.0,49.5  -- Empowered Brute
  kill 262169 x10 quest 95601.2 @48.3,49.6  -- Twilight Ritualist
  complete 95602 @47.7,49.8             -- destroy 5 Twilight Ritual Circles

step Clubtoe
  turnin 95601
  turnin 95602

step Chogg'Zac
  when group 95418
  tip Chogg'Zac, the two-headed ogre, is an elite (level 41) at the western edge of Sunnyglade: grouping up is advised. His heads go to Tran'gul and on to the ogres of Bolder'ok.
  accept 95418                          -- Clubtoe: Spread the Word
  accept 95427                          -- Twilight No More!
  collect 265750 quest 95427.2 @44.8,51.2  -- Chogg's Head
  collect 265751 quest 95427.1 @44.8,51.2  -- Zac's Head
  turnin 95427                          -- Clubtoe
  turnin 95418                          -- Tran'gul, in Rog'mar
  accept 95420                          -- Land of Giants
  turnin 95420                          -- Clugfist, in Bolder'ok

step Bolder'ok
  tip North up the valley to Bolder'ok, the ogres' town. Clugfist, its chieftain, sits on the hill; Jezap Jinglesprocket runs the Bloodmaster's Ring below; Gobam and Hamur stand nearby. The ogres are friendly while you leave them alone.
  accept 95424                          -- Clugfist: Might Makes Right
  accept 95428                          -- Clugfist's Decree: for Krom'rosh in Rog'mar, keep it
  accept 94668                          -- Bloodmaster's Ring
  turnin 94668                          -- Jezap Jinglesprocket
  accept 94733                          -- Our Ogre Friend
  turnin 94733                          -- Gobam
  accept 94734                          -- A Boar's Delight
  accept 95183                          -- Hamur: Step One: Rock

step Na'zok's camp
  tip East of Bolder'ok, Na'zok watches the Paletusk boars.
  accept 95163                          -- Drive Them Back

step The hills east of Bolder'ok
  tip The Twilight Maulers and Firecallers camp on the ridge east of Na'zok. The Young Paletusks wander the hills south of it: tap them with Na'zok's staff to send them home; The good rocks lie along the hills, the sweetberries grow on the bushes to the south-east.
  kill 260968 x7 quest 95424.1          -- Twilight Mauler
  kill 261497 x7 quest 95424.2 @75.7,26.9  -- Twilight Firecaller
  use 268521 quest 95163.1 @72.8,39.5   -- Swineherd's Staff, on the Young Paletusks
  collect 271892 x10 quest 95183.1 @73.7,33.7  -- Good Rock
  collect 265808 x8 quest 94734.1 @78.9,37.3  -- Sweetberry

step Na'zok
  turnin 95163

step Bolder'ok
  turnin 95424                          -- Clugfist
  turnin 95183                          -- Hamur

step The riverweed
  tip The riverweed grows along the river between Bolder'ok and Rog'mar, on the way south.
  collect 265806 x12 quest 94734.2 @56.1,44.9  -- Riverweed

step Gobam
  tip Back north to Gobam for his treat, then down to Rog'mar.
  turnin 94734
  accept 94737                          -- A Treat for a Friend
  turnin 94737                          -- Jezap Jinglesprocket

step Rog'mar
  turnin 95428                          -- Krom'rosh

step Fly to Kargath
  tip Grakna, Rog'mar's wind rider master, flies to Kargath in the Badlands, where the next guide starts.
  fly "Kargath"
  zone Badlands
